                                                "sense_id": "251586cb-aeb5-3d8b-80a5-34ea3447e0c4",
                                                "text": "The holy of holies, a cubical space of ten cubits on the side, was separated from the larger antechamber by four columns, which were also covered with gold and stood upon silver sockets; they bore a second curtain of four colors."
